  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Near Dragon Palace, Duke Long calls a newly formed Pure Dream Reality Seeker Physique body perfect and treats it as the eleventh extreme physique after Pure Dream Reality Seeker Transformation. Feng Jin Huang credits coincidence and points to her earlier killer move Shatter Dream as what the modification drew on.",
      "chapters": [
        1684
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_dragon_palace",
        "char_duke_long",
        "sys_pure_dream_reality_seeker_physique",
        "move_pure_dream_reality_seeker_transformation",
        "char_feng_jin_huang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Feng Jin Huang later recalls that Shadow Sect’s Pure Dream Reality Seeker Physique pursued stability and could not live long, so she walked the path of shatter dream and made it more unstable; under Fairy Zi Wei’s deduction that approach helped produce the perfect Pure Dream Reality Seeker Physique.",
      "chapters": [
        1685
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "research-path",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "char_fairy_zi_wei"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan’s Pure Dream Reality Seeker Physique bodies near Heavenly Court’s formation, Immortal killer move Shatter Dream fires with Pure Dream Reality Seeker Transformation. His bodies shatter at once, spread as dream realm fragments, then gather into new Pure Dream Reality Seeker Physique bodies that attack him instead. Fang Yuan notes that he himself does not have shatter dream to deal with such bodies.",
      "chapters": [
        1729
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "against-pure-dream-bodies",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Facing a vanguard of Pure Dream Reality Seeker Physique bodies, Feng Jin Huang borrows an immortal formation’s strength to activate shatter dream; the bodies explode into lumps of dream realm, and she then uses Pure Dream Reality Seeker Transformation to remake them under her control.",
      "chapters": [
        1942
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "formation-cast",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
